 to a user as `5,05` (`505 / 10 ** 2`).      * Tokens usually opt for a value of 18, imitating the relationship between Ether and Wei.      * NOTE: This information is only used for _display_ purposes: it in no way affects any of the arithmetic of the contract, including {IERC20-balanceOf} and {IERC20-transfer}."},"decreaseAllowance(address,uint256)":{"details":"Atomically decreases the allowance granted to `spender` by the caller.      * This is an alternative to {approve} that can be used as a mitigation for problems described in {IERC20-approve}.      * Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance.      * Requirements:      * - `spender` cannot be the zero address. - `spender` must have allowance for the caller of at least `subtractedValue`."},"getAPRs()":{"return":"addresses: array of token addressesaprs: array of aprs (ordered in respect to the `addresses` array)"},"getAllocations()":{"return":": array of allocations ordered as allAvailableTokens"},"getAvgAPR()":{"return":"avgApr: current weighted avg apr"},"getGovTokensAmounts(address)":{"params":{"_usr":": user address"},"return":": array of amounts for each gov token"},"increaseAllowance(address,uint256)":{"details":"Atomically increases the allowance granted to `spender` by the caller.      * This is an alternative to {approve} that can be used as a mitigation for problems described in {IERC20-approve}.      * Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance.      * Requirements:      * - `spender` cannot be the zero address."},"initialize(address)":{"details":"Initializes the contract in unpaused state. Assigns the Pauser role to the deployer."},"initialize(string,string,uint8)":{"details":"Sets the values for `name`, `symbol`, and `decimals`. All three of these values are immutable: they can only be set once during construction."},"isOwner()":{"details":"Returns true if the caller is the current owner."},"mintIdleToken(uint256,bool,address)":{"params":{"_amount":": amount of underlying token to be lended","_referral":": referral address"},"return":"mintedTokens : amount of IdleTokens minted"},"name()":{"details":"Returns the name of the token."},"openRebalance(uint256[])":{"params":{"_newAllocations":": array with new allocations in percentage"},"return":": whether has rebalanced or notavgApr : the new avg apr after rebalance"},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"pause()":{"details":"Called by a pauser to pause, triggers stopped state."},"paused()":{"details":"Returns true if the contract is paused, and false otherwise."},"rebalance()":{"return":": whether has rebalanced or not"},"rebalanceWithGST()":{"return":": whether has rebalanced or not"},"redeemIdleToken(uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":": amount of IdleTokens to be burned"},"return":"redeemedTokens : amount of underlying tokens redeemed"},"redeemInterestBearingTokens(uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":": amount of IdleTokens to be burned"}},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner.      * > Note: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"setAllAvailableTokensAndWrappers(address[],address[],uint256[],bool)":{"params":{"allocations":": array of allocations","keepAllocations":": whether to update lastRebalancerAllocations or not","protocolTokens":": array of protocolTokens addresses (eg [cDAI, iDAI, ...])","wrappers":": array of wrapper addresses (eg [IdleCompound, IdleFulcrum, ...])"}},"setAllocations(uint256[])":{"params":{"_allocations":": array with allocations in percentages (100% => 100000)"}},"setFee(uint256)":{"params":{"_fee":": fee amount where 100000 is 100%, max settable is 10%"}},"setFeeAddress(address)":{"params":{"_feeAddress":": fee address"}},"setGovTokens(address[],address[])":{"params":{"_newGovTokens":": array of governance token addresses","_protocolTokens":": array of interest bearing token addresses"}},"setIsRiskAdjusted(bool)":{"params":{"_isRiskAdjusted":": flag for openRebalance"}},"setMaxUnlentPerc(uint256)":{"params":{"_perc":": max unlent perc where 100000 is 100%"}},"setOracleAddress(address)":{"params":{"_oracle":": new oracle address"}},"setRebalancer(address)":{"params":{"_rebalancer":": new IdleRebalancerV3_1 address"}},"symbol()":{"details":"Returns the symbol of the token, usually a shorter version of the name."},"tokenPrice()":{"return":": price in underlying token"},"totalSupply()":{"details":"See {IERC20-totalSupply}."},"transfer(address,uint256)":{"params":{"amount":": value to transfer","recipient":": recipient account"},"return":": flag whether transfer was successful or not"},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"params":{"amount":": value to transfer","recipient":": recipient account","sender":": sender account"},"return":": flag whether transfer was successful or not"},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"unpause()":{"details":"Called by a pauser to unpause, returns to normal state."}}},"userdoc":{"methods":{"getAPRs()":{"notice":"Get APR of every ILendingProtocol "},"getAllocations()":{"notice":"Get latest allocations submitted by rebalancer "},"getAvgAPR()":{"notice":"Get current avg APR of this IdleToken "},"getGovTokensAmounts(address)":{"notice":"Get how many gov tokens a user is entitled to (this may not include eventual undistributed tokens) "},"mintIdleToken(uint256,bool,address)":{"notice":"Used to mint IdleTokens, given an underlying amount (eg. DAI). This method triggers a rebalance of the pools if _skipRebalance is set to false NOTE: User should 'approve' _amount of tokens before calling mintIdleToken NOTE 2: this method can be paused This method use GasTokens of this contract (if present) to get a gas discount "},"openRebalance(uint256[])":{"notice":"Allow any users to set new allocations as long as the new allocation gives a better avg APR than before Allocations should be in the format [100000, 0, 0, 0, ...] where length is the same as lastAllocations variable and the sum of all value should be == 100000    * This method is not callble if this instance of IdleToken is a risk adjusted instance NOTE: this method can be paused "},"rebalance()":{"notice":"Dynamic allocate all the pool across different lending protocols if needed, rebalance without params    * NOTE: this method can be paused "},"rebalanceWithGST()":{"notice":"Dynamic allocate all the pool across different lending protocols if needed, use gas refund from gasToken    * NOTE: this method can be paused. msg.sender should approve this contract to spend GST2 tokens before calling this method "},"redeemIdleToken(uint256)":{"notice":"Here we calc the pool share one can withdraw given the amount of IdleToken they want to burn "},"redeemInterestBearingTokens(uint256)":{"notice":"Here we calc the pool share one can withdraw given the amount of IdleToken they want to burn and send interest-bearing tokens (eg. cDAI/iDAI) directly to the user. Underlying (eg. DAI) is not redeemed here. "},"setAllAvailableTokensAndWrappers(address[],address[],uint256[],bool)":{"notice":"It allows owner to modify allAvailableTokens array in case of emergency ie if a bug on a interest bearing token is discovered and reset protocolWrappers associated with those tokens. "},"setAllocations(uint256[])":{"notice":"Used by Rebalancer to set the new allocations "},"setFee(uint256)":{"notice":"It allows owner to set the fee (1000 == 10% of gained interest) "},"setFeeAddress(address)":{"notice":"It allows owner to set the fee address "},"setGovTokens(address[],address[])":{"notice":"It allows owner to set gov tokens array In case of any errors gov distribution can be paused by passing an empty array "},"setIsRiskAdjusted(bool)":{"notice":"It allows owner to set the isRiskAdjusted flag "},"setMaxUnlentPerc(uint256)":{"notice":"It allows owner to set the max unlent asset percentage (1000 == 1% of unlent asset max) "},"setOracleAddress(address)":{"notice":"It allows owner to set the oracle address for getting avgAPR "},"setRebalancer(address)":{"notice":"It allows owner to set the IdleRebalancerV3_1 address "},"tokenPrice()":{"notice":"IdleToken price calculation, in underlying "},"transfer(address,uint256)":{"notice":"ERC20 modified transfer that also update the avgPrice paid for the recipient and updates user gov idx "},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"notice":"ERC20 modified transferFrom that also update the avgPrice paid for the recipient and updates user gov idx "}}}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"IdleTokenV3_1.sol":"IdleTokenV3_1"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":800},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"IdleTokenV3_1.sol":{"keccak256":"0x967bdb6baeb1f0a3ff2f8cf1d9573a0bd9b0c762f11881cdcf71b0e66ee3db9e","urls":["bzz-raw://0075303e307cec2a59b8a86f9d0877c11f49b3ac02f5a6f2831d030986ff8ef4","dweb:/ipfs/QmUWw2e88qfdUze1SCebhzMjEENcKZFaXMrUBz4swdKsx3"]}},"version":1}